thod (e.g., key press, screen tap, etc.).\n\n\n7. Tap OK.\n8. The app freezes and becomes unresponsive.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[gd_resource type=\"ConfigFile\" format=3]\n\n[application]\n\nconfig/name=\"GodotInputFreezeMRP\"\n\n[gd_resource type=\"ConfigFile\" format=3]\n\n[application]\n\nconfig/name=\"GodotInputFreezeMRP\"\n\nGo to the Edit , then Project then Edit project and then go to the Input Map and then add an Action and then click on add and then ok and this will freeze the screen.","closed_by":{"login":"GodotGameDevIndia","id":218947126,"node_id":"U_kgDODQzeNg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218947126?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GodotGameDevIndia","html_url":"https://github.com/GodotGameDevIndia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GodotGameDevIndia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GodotGameDevIndia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GodotGameDevIndia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GodotGameDevIndia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GodotGameDevIndia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GodotGameDevIndia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GodotGameDevIndia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GodotGameDevIndia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GodotGameDevIndia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108194/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108194/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}